__pycache__/
*.pyc
_site/
.voyage-session.json*

# a campaign's raw Voyage exports (a user who keeps them in the repo): never committed (SYNC-6)
campaigns/*/exports/

# the per-turn clock (when check-prompt first ran for the coming turn): a measuring aid, never committed (SES-9)
campaigns/*/data/.turn-clock
campaigns/*/data/.turn-clock.tmp

# Campfire mode's per-turn files (round and result packets, rulings, scene, ops; playbooks/campfire.md): commit-turn keeps the record in data/
campaigns/*/campfire/
